rem Fibonacci Golden Nuggets
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=137
rem Find the Nth positive integer x for
rem which the Fibonacci generating
rem function takes a rational value

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Nth integer = 15

rem The nuggets are products of
rem consecutive Fibonacci numbers,
rem F(2n) F(2n+1), from 2, 3, 5, 8...
Fs = fibonacci take (2 * Nth) array
Even = Fs (0 to # by 2)
Odd = Fs (1 to # by 2)
Nugget = Even * Odd
Answer = Nugget (Nth - 1)
Answer print
